        - If the given vertex index is at the end of a linestring, the adjacent
          index will be -1 (for "no adjacent vertex")
        - If the given vertex index is at the end of a linear ring (such as in a
          polygon), the adjacent index will take into account the first vertex
          is equal to the last vertex (and will skip equal vertex positions).
        """
