    implementation in `QgsProviderRegistry`. To save memory, data
    providers are only actually loaded via QLibrary calls if they're to be
    used. (Though they're all iteratively loaded once to get their metadata
    information, and then unloaded when the `QgsProviderRegistry`
    is created.) `QgsProviderMetadata` supplies enough information
